== Art and writing: all rights reserved ==

Copyright (c) 2026 blinxxy. All rights reserved.

This covers everything that isn't code: all images (the art/ folder, the
content pack's assets, and docs/media), the maps, the character Sable,
and all writing (dialogue, events, letters, item text, the i18n files
and the wiki). You may not reuse, edit or redistribute them, in whole or
in part, without written permission.

Translations are welcome: you may translate the mod's i18n files and
share your translation for use with Pelican Palette, with credit.

